39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, the results are in! It looks like we have some great experts on the bench who aren't doing anything, but finding field crews is going to be a total nightmare! This is exactly what I was worried about!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
